                                "sense_id": "0f329a5d-77ba-377e-9bcf-59af3575e3d4",
                                "text": "So when I say that my Auntie's piety was not of the niggerish kind..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06f3d296-1d27-4251-a7d5-9b8af495c0d1",
                                "sense_id": "0f329a5d-77ba-377e-9bcf-59af3575e3d4",
                                "text": "[T]hey should specially avoid the fanatics who […] have temporarily changed a federal republic into a sort of niggerish monarchy or empire […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5419b685-dc49-4fb0-ba19-a002b61b31c3",
                                "sense_id": "0f329a5d-77ba-377e-9bcf-59af3575e3d4",
                                "text": "She told him in her native Virginia mountain-area dialect: \"That's what ah said. Ah don't like these niggerish places.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea81e7a3-8536-413a-a73a-30883016760e",
                                "sense_id": "0f329a5d-77ba-377e-9bcf-59af3575e3d4",
                                "text": "In a voice dripping with sarcasm, Bernhard related, \"Mariah's been getting a little niggerish on us... she been seeing those rap stars...\""
                            }
                        ]
