                                "sense_id": "f76a0978-680c-31c1-b69d-56847b8bd4f9",
                                "text": "You all seem really fucked-up, talking niggerish and all--'taken care\nof' means ELIMINATION thru DEADLY MEANS! SEE its POLL @ goodbuddytoil\non YAHOO."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "313d7def-c7f5-4d28-9f31-1ec4a8e21241",
                                "sense_id": "f76a0978-680c-31c1-b69d-56847b8bd4f9",
                                "text": "But the good news is he's gonna make us all learn Spanish and\nNiggerish and I figure when we are called to arms being able to tell\nthe Beaners and the Nappy Power Rangers what we think so they can\nunderstand it is a good thing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64b1ddb6-4e11-4245-8f90-fe2163d15e26",
                                "sense_id": "f76a0978-680c-31c1-b69d-56847b8bd4f9",
                                "text": "One boy claims he speaks “niggerish.\" Whatever they are speaking I do not understand, which is good."
